<title>CANADA: Repap shareholders approve Avenor deal.</title>
<headline>Repap shareholders approve Avenor deal.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Repap Enterprises Inc said on Wednesday that its shareholders approved the proposed merger of the company with Avenor Inc.</p>
<p>The company said that 92 percent of shares voted were in favor of the deal.</p>
<p>Avenor said its shareholders rejected the deal at a separate meeting.</p>
</text>
